+	 * irq51/52/54 read the same block at 1 MHz and at 4.2 MHz and both returned the
+	 * same "EFI EFI ", while the host-side parameters (bs/bc/sdm) were correct. Go
+	 * back to the identification clock (~400 kHz, the same divider used before CMD0)
+	 * and change nothing about the bus: no CMD6 bus-width switch, 1-bit host, same
